      "body": "## What changed\n\n- Validate that a cached validation-error context belongs to the current endpoint. Keep endpoint references only in a bounded cache so Python cannot reuse a cached function ID for another endpoint.\n- Add a regression test for stale cache entries and explain the user-visible behavior in `README.md` (generated from the docs index).\n- Add a narrowly scoped pytest filter for the current import-time AnyIO deprecation in Starlette's test client. Upstream tracking: https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/issues/3497.\n\nCloses #16390.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pytest tests/test_validation_error_context.py -q`: 8 passed.\n- Source-distribution test suite with AnyIO 4.15.1: 3,329 passed, 37 skipped, 5 xfailed.\n- `prek` checks for changed files: passed.\n- Full GitHub Actions checks are running on this update.\r\n",
      "changed_files": 5,
      "closed_at": null,
